// The application icon of rfg.exe (applicationicon.res in the original build).
// Extracted from its .rsrc section; the .ico file name is inferred from the .res name.
// Location: next to game/assets/global/applicationicon.hpp, the path rfg.pdb records (the .rc path itself is not recorded).

// Magic number: 0x0409, en-US, the language of every resource in rfg.exe.
LANGUAGE 0x09, 0x01

// Magic number: 101, the id os.cpp and application.cpp load (the window class icons, GameFrameworkParameters::windowIcon).
101 ICON "applicationicon.ico"
